# The AuthZEN wire types are GENERATED with LF line endings, and their currency
# is checked by a BYTE comparison against what the generator emits
# (AuthZENGeneratedTypesAreCurrentTest). On a platform where git rewrites line
# endings at checkout, that comparison fails for a reason nobody changed - which
# is exactly what happened on the Windows CI runner: identical text, CRLF on
# disk, LF from the emitter.
#
# Scoped rather than a repo-wide `* text=auto eol=lf`, because changing the
# checkout behaviour of every other file in the repository is a bigger decision
# than this lane, and one nobody asked for.
src/main/java/com/getaxonflow/sdk/authzen/*.java text eol=lf
testdata/authzen-surface.json                    text eol=lf
